---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PhotoGallery from '../../../components/PhotoGallery.astro';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import { getVillaImages } from '../../../lib/galleries.js';
import heroVilla from '../../../images/villa-hero.jpg';

const hero = heroVilla;
const galleryImages = getVillaImages();
---

<Layout title="The Villa" description="About Villa Rosengarten and its history – built in 1920, lovingly restored since 2015.">
  <section class="wrap" style="padding-top:3rem;">
    <p class="eyebrow">Villa Rosengarten</p>
    <h1>Our story</h1>
    <Image
      class="villa-hero"
      src={hero}
      alt="Villa Rosengarten in summer"
      widths={[600, 1000, 1600]}
      sizes="(max-width: 1100px) 100vw, 1040px"
      loading="eager"
    />

    <div class="legal-content">
      <p>
        Fehmarn was, for us, always more than just a travel destination. It was
        the place we kept returning to – to kitesurf, for long walks with our
        dogs along the sea, or simply to enjoy the calm, the wind and the
        island’s special atmosphere.
      </p>
      <p>
        On one of these visits, we discovered Villa Rosengarten. From the first
        glance, it was clear: this house has a soul. The architecture, the old
        trees and the charm of the property captivated us immediately. When the
        opportunity to take over the villa arose in 2015, we didn’t have to
        think twice.
      </p>
      <p>
        With a great deal of passion, attention to detail and respect for the
        house’s history, we extensively restored and modernised the villa,
        built in 1920. Our goal was to preserve its original character while
        creating a place where our guests feel completely at home – stylish,
        comfortable and with all the amenities that make for a relaxed stay.
      </p>
      <p>
        Today, Villa Rosengarten combines historic elegance with modern living
        comfort. Professional high-speed WiFi makes it just as much the
        perfect retreat for remote work as for a longer holiday. Those who
        work in the morning with a view of the greenery and spend their
        evenings at the beach or on the water experience a very special
        balance between work and relaxation.
      </p>
      <p>
        Fehmarn offers exceptional opportunities all year round: endless
        beaches, nature, watersports, cycling routes and the vastness of the
        Baltic Sea. Whether you’re a kitesurfer, cyclist, dog owner, nature
        lover, or simply someone looking to escape everyday life for a while –
        everyone finds their own favourite spot here.
      </p>
      <p>
        Our small sauna and the fitness area in the old barn are available to
        our guests in the low season and winter, by individual appointment and
        for a surcharge, and invite you to do something good for body and mind.
        Of course, four-legged family members are warmly welcome too – because
        we know from our own experience that a holiday is only complete when
        man’s best friend can come along.
      </p>
      <p>
        We look forward to welcoming you to Villa Rosengarten and sharing our
        enthusiasm for this special place with you.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  {galleryImages.length > 0 && (
    <section class="wrap">
      <h2 class="section-title">Impressions of the villa</h2>
      <PhotoGallery images={galleryImages} name="Villa Rosengarten" layout="masonry" />
    </section>
  )}

  <section class="wrap">
    <div class="legal-content">
      <h2>The apartments at a glance</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="/en/zwergenfee/"><strong>Zwergenfee</strong></a> – in the annex</li>
        <li><a href="/en/loft/"><strong>Loft</strong></a> – on the garden level</li>
        <li><a href="/en/romantika/"><strong>Romantika</strong></a> – on the raised ground floor of the main house</li>
        <li><a href="/en/sommerwind/"><strong>Sommerwind</strong></a> – with roof terrace in the main house</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="wrap">
    <div class="related-grid">
      <a class="related-card" href="/en/wintervilla/">
        <h3>The villa in winter</h3>
        <p>Frosty coastlines, fireside evenings and quiet walks – Fehmarn has its charm outside summer too.</p>
        <span class="related-cta">Discover the winter villa →</span>
      </a>
      <a class="related-card" href="/en/sauna-fitness/">
        <h3>Sauna &amp; fitness</h3>
        <p>Our own wellness area for guests – by individual appointment.</p>
        <span class="related-cta">Learn more →</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
